{"id": "DfSxAyeyYT7", "title": "Video by karissa.wampler", "description": "How I grew an audience of 2M+ (part 1 - situationmaxxing)\n\nSomething I’ve learned is that filming what you’re ACTUALLY doing is way more sustainable AND fun than curating “perfect” looking videos. “Situationmaxxing” as I like to call it is just looking for opportunities to film B-Roll clips. \n\nI do this when I’m traveling and build a huge “trial reels” folder in my photos app with these videos. You can film these in the most RANDOM locations when you have extra time - like how I did at this car wash. You just make the most of whatever random situation you’re in when you see an opportunity. \n\nThis 5 minutes I spent filming will give me clips that I can make a TON of videos with. I add music and captions that fit around my niche and go with my content. \n\nI can make  30-50 trial reel videos (very quickly) with this in a day if I want by playing content roulette with them - which I will explain how to do in part 2 :) \n\nI think it’s fun to explain the behind the scenes of creating content like this so let me know if this is helpful and I can create more tutorials like this <3\n\n& thank you @pshepfpv for putting me onto edits and encouraging me to blast trials 🙏🏼✨", "channel": "karissa.wampler", "uploader_id": "314351936", "uploader": "Karissa Wampler", "timestamp": 1793738700, "like_count": 35935, "comment_count": 567, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-2991099777900788a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 79.11, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://scontent-ord5-2.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQOGsP7kZto0bvjYGyy5A5DGekJWEFUX6oaImKU0i_ACmCEsZUpSxqPYAq1Lp_NPvjU4Xkxqqc50w_NPRRe8hGYw0rqc1mtRSQxgVHM.mp4?_nc_cat=108&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=QXnQoXsFbi8Q7kNvwHDeHOm&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=VKV7fVSohmOfDkPTcGzbWw&_nc_ss=70689