KV7fVSohmOfDkPTcGzbWw&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_ct=RQosPBUIFQ4lBAAAAA&oh=00_AQQDKRHZfuknEotep1SjyJAVB9A8wJXhLNkVwF1tajePYA&oe=6B092721", "width": 640, "height": 1136, "id": "10", "resolution": "640x1136"}], "comments": [{"author": "thomashayesstudio", "author_id": "3464838654", "id": "18123125213076952", "text": "Literlaly 😂", "timestamp": 1795372106, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "kaotickaya", "author_id": "1426204698", "id": "18409668619206470", "text": "Also leads to endless posts of useless content that floods the internet, the type of content conscious people (not zombies) avoid", "timestamp": 1795349997, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "samarmiu", "author_id": "978337235", "id": "17957143581304333", "text": "I’m the same, always noticing opportunities mainly bc my creative brain likes pretty things but no one should have to be pumping out 20 vids a day. The reason I like making content is bc I have lots of ideas. But if I’m making 20 a day, undoubtedly some of those are going to be of no value to anyone whatsoever. I refuse to believe this is sustainable or enjoyable for most people. If it is for you, you’re an exception", "timestamp": 1795309424, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "realdakotahblue", "author_id": "22470478560", "id": "18657907864055213", "text": "Ty for this", "timestamp": 1795304816, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "vuksebastian.fm", "author_id": "7879508874", "id": "17990833229877959", "text": "This is gold!", "timestamp": 1795303680, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "mafercute_742", "author_id": "4652938336", "id": "17943209655399877", "text": "this makes me sad for some reason we're not humans anymore", "timestamp": 1795292128, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "ricoharv", "author_id": "5560464155", "id": "18125055973935673", "text": "Him washing his car and you teaching us how to pose is taking me out idk why 😂", "timestamp": 1795274747, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "wildsoulalchemist", "author_id": "28884112457", "id": "18135799747670758", "text": "I have a question about posting 20 trial reels a day.  I have been worried to post more than 1 reel every 3 hrs.  I worry bc I read that they will compete with each other and effect views. I’m guessing that it’s not true if you are posting 20 a day and gaining so many followers?", "timestamp": 1795240863, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "sophmargue", "author_id": "23056206574", "id": "18045230600835950", "text": "This is the way you have to think about social media to gain a following on multiple platforms. Everything is you see becomes content. Everywhere you go. Everything you do. That mindset can get to a person after a while", "timestamp": 1795206855, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "tabeabussmann", "author_id": "7317214509", "id": "17982174332922464", "text": "A photographers normal life", "timestamp": 1795197351, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "futureboostedmedia", "author_id": "301364936", "id": "18660780148049956", "text": ".. the content I make takes a while to film and edit. I also have a full time job", "timestamp": 1795189304, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "rumitabaruah", "author_id": "4072701866", "id": "18025732304948634", "text": "Girl your face card is enough ❤️❤️", "timestamp": 1795175451, "like_count": 0}], "webpage_url": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/DfSxAyeyYT7/", "webpage_url_basename": "DfSxAyeyYT7", "webpage_url_domain": "instagram.com", "extractor": "Instagram", "extractor_key": "Instagram", "thumbnail": "https://scontent-ord5-2.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.71878-15/890353318_3584077095101679_9032502570773332611_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ig_cache_key=NDAyMjQ5Mjk3NTY3NzkzMjc5NTI5OTExMDAwMDQ1Njc0MzI%3D.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjY0MC5zZHIudmlkZW9fdXNlcl9zZWxlY3RlZF90aHVtYm5haWwuQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=fhFItAY3GzgQ7kNvwGUm4Yi&_nc_oc=Adr_k82t3c47j7lBydoHG0s0_739PFLCkQBlXdsEYLfnDWDvqs8p2nP84h_--WTr68I&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=VKV7fVSohmOfDkPTcGzbWw&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_